title: Max Hoelz
subtitle: The Vogtland's Red Guard will not lay down its arms.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1920 and month = 4 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and ending_id = 0 and comrade_hoelz = 1 and e20_hoelz_line = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 2
on-arrival: {!
RG.district('saxony', {guards: 1, militancy: 4});
!}

= Max Hoelz

Max Hoelz is a lathe operator from Falkenstein who came back from the war to lead the town's unemployed. When Kapp marched he formed a Red Guard of a few hundred men, took the town halls of Falkenstein and Plauen, made the factory owners pay a levy for the unemployed and burned the land registers. Kapp has fled, and Hoelz has kept going.

The Reichswehr is closing on the Vogtland. The papers call him a bandit. He carries our party card. [? if levi_chair = 1 : Levi wants him out: a party is not a band of guerrillas. ?]

- @expel: Expel Hoelz, and say why.
- @border: Get him and his men over the border into Bohemia.
- @back: Stand by him, and send rifles to the Vogtland.

@expel
subtitle: The unemployed of the Vogtland will not understand. Our Left will not forgive it.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e20_hoelz_line = 1;
RG.expel('hoelz', {news: 'Communist Zentrale expels Max Hoelz', priority: 2});
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 8;
RG.district('saxony', {loyalty: -6});
!}

Hoelz reads the circular in a barn near Klingenthal. He joins the KAPD within the month.

@border
subtitle: Costs 1 fund for guides and papers.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e20_hoelz_line = 2;
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.exile('hoelz', {news: 'Max Hoelz escapes into Czechoslovakia', priority: 2});
RG.district('saxony', {guards: -0.5, repression: -3});
!}

Hoelz and forty of his men cross the mountains at night, with their rifles buried behind them. The Czech police intern them politely. The Reichswehr finds the town halls of Falkenstein empty.

@back
subtitle: Ten days of war in the Vogtland. He may well be taken.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e20_hoelz_line = 3;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.district('saxony', {guards: 1.5, militancy: 6, repression: 10});
if (Math.random() < 0.45) {
    Q.e20_hoelz_caught = 1;
    RG.arrest('hoelz', 8, {news: 'Max Hoelz captured by the Reichswehr', priority: 3});
} else {
    Q.e20_hoelz_caught = 0;
    RG.exile('hoelz', {news: 'Max Hoelz breaks through to Bohemia', priority: 2});
}
!}

The Saxon district sends him rifles and men. [? if e20_hoelz_caught = 1 : The Reichswehr closes the ring, and Hoelz is taken in a forester's hut, still arguing. ?][? if e20_hoelz_caught = 0 : The Reichswehr closes the ring, and Hoelz slips through it into Bohemia with a price on his head. ?]
